---
import { linkFor } from '@/lib/links';
const link = linkFor(Astro.url.pathname);
---

<section class="section_about-v3-mission">
        <div class="section-gap is-hscroll-sticky">
          <div class="container-main">
            <div class="about-v3-mission-wrapper">
              <div class="about-v3-mission-row">
                <h2 data-wf-target="[[[&quot;6b03d9375de33e5d414c268c&quot;,&quot;4c35f570-ca7c-f6ec-92f4-e997b2e34bb3&quot;],[]]]" class="about-v3-mission-title">Our Mission To Empower Business Through AI-Powered Innovative Solutions</h2>
                <p data-wf-target="[[[&quot;6b03d9375de33e5d414c268c&quot;,&quot;ca83df50-3fb7-d554-82f0-37955c33897b&quot;],[]]]" class="about-v3-mission-text">Before any agent goes live, we sit down with your team to map what the workflow actually needs. What it has to do. Where it can flex. What can’t change. The plan that comes out of that conversation isn’t a guess dressed up as a proposal. It’s a clear direction.</p>
                <h3 data-wf-target="[[[&quot;6b03d9375de33e5d414c268c&quot;,&quot;09a0b4b6-6d0e-b15e-a4a1-7e4acf9eda3f&quot;],[]]]" class="about-v3-mission-title is-next">Our Vision For A Future Where Every Workflow Runs Itself</h3>
                <p data-wf-target="[[[&quot;6b03d9375de33e5d414c268c&quot;,&quot;7797a98c-e94a-67a5-65f7-1ce28e4940c1&quot;],[]]]" class="about-v3-mission-text is-next">We picture teams that spend their days on judgment, not busywork. Agents handle the handoffs, the follow-ups and the data entry quietly in the background, while people stay firmly in control. Every automation we ship moves a business one step closer to that future, without adding complexity to the tools it already trusts.</p>
                <h3 data-wf-target="[[[&quot;6b03d9375de33e5d414c268c&quot;,&quot;f5745e7b-d144-a453-5394-b3369909a748&quot;],[]]]" class="about-v3-mission-title is-next">Our Values Keep Every Agent Transparent, Secure And Accountable</h3>
                <p data-wf-target="[[[&quot;6b03d9375de33e5d414c268c&quot;,&quot;6ed27cab-92eb-95f4-8656-b4fd9c13b9c5&quot;],[]]]" class="about-v3-mission-text is-next">We build in the open with you. Every agent logs its decisions so you can see why it acted, your data never trains anyone else’s model, and nothing ships until your team signs off. Clear pricing, honest timelines and real people on the other end of every support request.</p>
                <div data-reveal="fade-up" class="about-v3-mission-visual">
                  <div data-wf-target="[[[&quot;6b03d9375de33e5d414c268c&quot;,&quot;5f524dae-83a4-a9db-8283-cfc351e10464&quot;],[]]]" class="about-v3-mission-card is-back"><img src="/images/synthora-about-v3-mission-back_1synthora-about-v3-mission-back.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/synthora-about-v3-mission-back_1-p-500.webp 500w, /images/synthora-about-v3-mission-back_1synthora-about-v3-mission-back.webp 722w" alt="Colleagues discussing results from an AI-powered workflow dashboard" class="about-v3-mission-image">
                    <div class="about-v3-mission-overlay"></div>
                  </div>
                  <div data-wf-target="[[[&quot;6b03d9375de33e5d414c268c&quot;,&quot;1384e493-1e62-ddbe-dc69-a9790e239d12&quot;],[]]]" class="about-v3-mission-card is-mid"><img src="/images/synthora-about-v3-mission-mid_1synthora-about-v3-mission-mid.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/synthora-about-v3-mission-mid_1-p-500.webp 500w, /images/synthora-about-v3-mission-mid_1synthora-about-v3-mission-mid.webp 762w" alt="Product team planning an AI automation roadmap around a laptop" class="about-v3-mission-image"></div>
                  <div data-wf-target="[[[&quot;6b03d9375de33e5d414c268c&quot;,&quot;3b8d5519-ba00-60c8-7bfa-880964c1472e&quot;],[]]]" class="about-v3-mission-card is-front"><img src="/images/synthora-about-v3-mission-front_1synthora-about-v3-mission-front.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/synthora-about-v3-mission-front_1-p-500.webp 500w, /images/synthora-about-v3-mission-front_1-p-800.webp 800w, /images/synthora-about-v3-mission-front_1synthora-about-v3-mission-front.webp 802w" alt="Two engineers reviewing AI agent code together on a monitor" class="about-v3-mission-image"></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="about-v3-mission-actions">
                <a data-wf-target="[[[&quot;403d8bcb-23c5-ae0d-e0ae-e76c4e0d34f4&quot;,&quot;403d8bcb-23c5-ae0d-e0ae-e76c4e0d34f4&quot;],[&quot;cc41472b-a170-65ef-3ae0-57131661085b&quot;]]]" data-wf-component-id="403d8bcb-23c5-ae0d-e0ae-e76c4e0d34f4" data-wf-variant-state="base" {...link('/contact', 'primary-button w-inline-block')}>
                  <div class="button-text-mask">
                    <div data-wf-target="[[[&quot;403d8bcb-23c5-ae0d-e0ae-e76c4e0d34f4&quot;,&quot;403d8bcb-23c5-ae0d-e0ae-e76c4e0d34f6&quot;],[&quot;cc41472b-a170-65ef-3ae0-57131661085b&quot;]]]" class="button-text">Get In Touch</div>
                    <div data-wf-target="[[[&quot;403d8bcb-23c5-ae0d-e0ae-e76c4e0d34f4&quot;,&quot;403d8bcb-23c5-ae0d-e0ae-e76c4e0d34f8&quot;],[&quot;cc41472b-a170-65ef-3ae0-57131661085b&quot;]]]" class="button-text is-hover">Get In Touch</div>
                  </div>
                  <div data-wf-target="[[[&quot;403d8bcb-23c5-ae0d-e0ae-e76c4e0d34f4&quot;,&quot;403d8bcb-23c5-ae0d-e0ae-e76c4e0d34fa&quot;],[&quot;cc41472b-a170-65ef-3ae0-57131661085b&quot;]]]" class="button-icon w-embed"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 16 15" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                      <circle cx="10.666" cy="3.2" r="1.067"></circle>
                      <circle cx="8.533" cy="1.067" r="1.067"></circle>
                      <circle cx="14.933" cy="7.466" r="1.067"></circle>
                      <circle cx="1.067" cy="7.466" r="1.067"></circle>
                      <circle cx="4.268" cy="7.466" r="1.067"></circle>
                      <circle cx="7.467" cy="7.466" r="1.067"></circle>
                      <circle cx="10.666" cy="7.466" r="1.067"></circle>
                      <circle cx="12.8" cy="9.6" r="1.067"></circle>
                      <circle cx="10.666" cy="11.733" r="1.067"></circle>
                      <circle cx="8.533" cy="13.866" r="1.067"></circle>
                      <circle cx="12.8" cy="5.333" r="1.067"></circle>
                    </svg></div>
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
